**/test
# Everything below keeps a developer's working tree out of the image. The sources are now
# copied after `pnpm install`, so a host node_modules would land on top of the one the
# image installed; and a host .tsbuildinfo would tell `tsc` the outputs already exist
# while its dist/ was never copied, leaving the image with no compiled code at all.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
